const VOX2 = {"There you are. You came up the sump drain. Nobody comes up the sump drain.":"v2_21e1b67c","You smell of chlorine. I can smell it down the line.":"v2_55fec890","Walk north along the pipe. Door says Boiler Office. I'll be at the gauges.":"v2_7c852e37","Don't come round the front.":"v2_2abc621b","I said don't.":"v2_711d9991","That's the knock. Shelter. Now.":"v2_6ff9bcca","That's the knock again. Shelter.":"v2_13b291a2","Stop at the cot. I'm working.":"v2_83a16cc1","Ida. Night engineer. I've been on nights a long time.":"v2_f41e7775","You'll want the lift. Everyone wants the lift.":"v2_e537a28e","The lift runs on two things it hasn't had in years. Power, and the pressure down.":"v2_7946275c","Power's in the Switchyard, north. The crew know which breakers. They won't tell you. They'll show you.":"v2_49841d0b","Pressure is three regulators. West in the galleries, north in the Switchyard, east at the end of the Long Pipe.":"v2_458e4b34","Shut each one. All the way. I'll see it on the gauges.":"v2_23a30e75","When the pipes knock three times, get in a shelter. Green lamp. The steam doesn't care what you're doing.":"v2_382b22db","Where did you find that.":"v2_e5247c10","Keep it.":"v2_a7483351","No. Take it up with you. Somebody up there should have it.":"v2_9c69d418","You've been in their store. Did they leave the stove on?":"v2_4f80dfcd","They always left the stove on.":"v2_8949f75e","Benny's out? He'll want you to tell me the coffee was terrible.":"v2_e0cc7e99","It was.":"v2_774d3984","Go on up. I've got the gauges.":"v2_5e2d224e","It's quiet. I don't like it quiet. Go on.":"v2_31b692ce","Drink something cold.":"v2_9d13f48b","Keep out of the steam.":"v2_defb418a","I can hear you dripping on my floor.":"v2_f71bc042","Hey. Hey! Is that a person? Say something if you're a person.":"v2_d91a3971","Door's jammed. I've been sat in here with the wheel in my lap for, I don't know. What day is it?":"v2_3d41717d","Get a bar. Anything long. I'm not walking that pipe again. It lives out there.":"v2_bf931cd3","Oh, thank God. You've got a face. Sorry. That's a weird thing to say.":"v2_f70b5001","Here. The east wheel. I took it off so nobody could turn it while I was in here. Didn't think that through.":"v2_e0336ac4","Keep your light on it and don't run. It likes runners.":"v2_17eb580c","That's all I know. That and the coffee here is terrible. Tell Ida I said.":"v2_525d85c0","Quiet, huh. I'll wait. Somebody has to tell the next one about the bar.":"v2_130f546a","Go on. I'll follow when it's properly quiet. Ten minutes. An hour.":"v2_52d01ed2","I'm staying put. You go. You'll be fine. Probably.":"v2_fbfcd7bd","Ida never comes out of that office. You noticed that?":"v2_b4ec709b","If you see Hollis, he owes me a radio.":"v2_7dffb4dc","Pick that up.":"v2_7539b352","Lights just came up on the lift board. Your crew did that.":"v2_de675a67","West is shut. I felt that one in my teeth.":"v2_8a16b104","North is shut. Good crew up there.":"v2_aff203a7","East is shut. Is Benny with you? Don't answer, I can hear him.":"v2_364429d5","That's all three. It's gone quiet. Lift's live.":"v2_8f1247cf","Office. North. I'm not going anywhere.":"v2_8ddf822f","Come and see me. I don't say it twice on the phone.":"v2_81ceb464","You're breathing hard. Cold store. Sit with the door shut a minute.":"v2_586af069","Go west, to the galleries. Mind the water, it's hotter than it looks.":"v2_0e85ad76","The Switchyard crew will show you the breakers. Watch the foreman's hands.":"v2_b0529155","You've got power. North regulator's in the cage by the cabinets.":"v2_4b26b9c3","The valve room door sticks. There's a bar in the Gamma Team's store, west.":"v2_f8002620","East. End of the Long Pipe. Light on it, don't run.":"v2_1189287a","The lift. Go on.":"v2_67aa6a9d","Nine. Camera, you dropped off our board an hour ago. You're reading hot.":"v2_c3efcaaa","Nine. We see a lift moving on a level we don't have. If that's you, keep the tape running.":"v2_ea92258c","Hale. It is warm where you are. Drink before you are thirsty.":"v2_91a9580a","…you're on shift…":"v2_414d8d45","…someone has to watch the gauges…":"v2_55576140","…it's cooler further in…":"v2_9eee2bbb","…put your card in…":"v2_6694895d","…take your helmet off, it's hot…":"v2_e7a1746a"};
